// ============================================
// shadcn/ui Components Directory
// ============================================
// FILE: src/components/ui/.gitkeep
//
// This directory will be populated by running:
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest init
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest add button input label select textarea
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest add dialog dropdown-menu tabs toast
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest add table card badge separator avatar
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest add tooltip popover calendar progress skeleton
//   npx shadcn-ui@latest add command sheet scroll-area
//
// Each command generates a component file in this directory.
// These are real, working components — not stubs.
//
// REQUIRED COMPONENTS:
//   1.  button.tsx       — Primary, secondary, ghost, destructive variants
//   2.  input.tsx        — Text input with error state
//   3.  label.tsx        — Form label
//   4.  select.tsx       — Radix Select (thrust area, UoM, department dropdowns)
//   5.  textarea.tsx     — Multi-line input (descriptions, comments)
//   6.  dialog.tsx       — Modal dialogs (confirm, create, edit)
//   7.  dropdown-menu.tsx— User menu, context menus
//   8.  tabs.tsx         — Quarter tabs, analytics tabs
//   9.  toast.tsx        — Success/error notifications
//   10. toaster.tsx      — Toast provider (mounted in root layout)
//   11. table.tsx        — Base table primitives
//   12. card.tsx         — Card container
//   13. badge.tsx        — Status badges, role badges
//   14. separator.tsx    — Horizontal/vertical dividers
//   15. avatar.tsx       — User avatars
//   16. tooltip.tsx      — Hover tooltips
//   17. popover.tsx      — Popover panels
//   18. calendar.tsx     — Date picker for timeline UoM
//   19. progress.tsx     — Progress bars (weightage, completion)
//   20. skeleton.tsx     — Loading skeletons
//   21. command.tsx      — Command palette (optional, nice-to-have)
//   22. sheet.tsx        — Mobile sidebar overlay
//   23. scroll-area.tsx  — Custom scrollbar wrapper
// ============================================
